engine/godot/pulls/115351","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115351","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115351.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115351.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-26T21:04:53Z"},"body":"This PR makes the EditorPropertyFlags not create a checkbox for enum entries with zero value, like `None = 0`. Such created checkboxes were broken / not usable before anyway.\r\n\r\nResolves https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14023.\r\n\r\nNote the above proposal is about C#, but the issue is not C# specific. In GDScript, `@export_flags` indeed prevents adding `0` value arguments:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"920\" height=\"100\" alt=\"Godot_v4 6-rc2_win64_KXclF3Nl6F\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9406caa6-17a1-4c0f-8c76-9ecae98c67c5\" />\r\n\r\nbut it could still be added manually e.g. using `_validate_property`:\r\n```gdscript\r\n@tool\r\nextends Node\r\n\r\n@export_flags(\"First:1\", \"Second:2\", \"Third:4\") var flags: int = 0\r\n\r\nfunc _validate_property(property: Dictionary) -> void:\r\n\tif property.name == \"flags\":\r\n\t\tproperty.hint_string += \",None:0\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nResult for the script above:\r\n\r\nBefore<br>v4.6.rc2.official [78c6632eb]|After<br>this PR\r\n-|-\r\n![Godot_v4 6-rc2_win64_hgCyet6WoW](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f737ad9a-2096-4c8e-9503-c6666de20323)|<img width=\"267\" height=\"101\" alt=\"godot windows editor dev x86_64_P2yELM3gTW\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06a9bfa4-f56d-4451-9132-602bedf7bbe5\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115351/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115351/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}